# Delivering Business Value

## Description
  
We will ensure services deliver required business outcomes and maximise benefits while minimising cost, contributing to organisational capability, effectiveness and efficiency.

### Rationale

Investment in data and digital capabilities must support organisational outcomes and operational resilience. Resources should be directed towards the wider objectives of the enterprise.

### Implications

- Track requirements and benefits through delivery.
- Measure the contribution of services to business outcomes.
- Simplify and standardise wherever possible.
- Avoid duplicate platforms and overlapping capabilities.
- Prefer configuration of commercial off-the-shelf products over customisation.
- Prefer customisation over bespoke development where practical.
